# merge 决策分支4：两边删除同一文件则同删不冲突；
# 混入 given 新增文件以产生净改动，merge 成功
> init
<<<
+ gone.txt mbase.txt
> add gone.txt
<<<
> commit "base"
<<<
> branch other
<<<

# current 侧删除 gone.txt
> rm gone.txt
<<<
> commit "current deletes"
<<<

# given 侧也删除 gone.txt，并新增 only.txt
> checkout other
<<<
> rm gone.txt
<<<
+ only.txt monlygiven.txt
> add only.txt
<<<
> commit "given deletes plus only"
<<<

> checkout master
<<<
> merge other
<<<

# gone.txt 不存在，only.txt 采纳；无冲突、工作区干净
* gone.txt
= only.txt monlygiven.txt
> status
=== Branches ===
*master
other

=== Staged Files ===

=== Removed Files ===

=== Modifications Not Staged For Commit ===

=== Untracked Files ===

<<<
